WEBVTT

00:16:58.292 --> 00:17:01.268
the kid takes a little object
and they drop it.

00:17:01.292 --> 00:17:05.018
And for the first time they realize
that this object continues to exist,

00:17:05.042 --> 00:17:07.351
even when they don't see it.

00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:10.518
And then there is that game
where they pick it up, they throw it,

00:17:10.542 --> 00:17:12.018
you pick it up, they throw it,

00:17:12.042 --> 00:17:15.184
and they develop this thing
called object constancy.

00:17:15.208 --> 00:17:18.684
Object constancy then leads
to people constancy, and it's peekaboo.

00:17:18.708 --> 00:17:20.976
Peekaboo means that even
when I don't see you,

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.268
you're still there,

00:17:22.292 --> 00:17:24.851
and even though you're not
seeing me, I'm still there.

00:17:24.875 --> 00:17:28.059
And it becomes the foundation,
against the fear of abandonment.

00:17:28.083 --> 00:17:30.059
It is the foundation of trust.